abstract: >-
  Neutron diffraction arrays, pyRS-exported fitted quantities, metadata,
  and MATLAB and Python analysis code used to evaluate residual strain,
  gauge-volume alignment sensitivity, and crystallographic texture in
  recovered Arecibo Telescope cable wires.
keywords:
  - neutron diffraction
  - residual strain
  - residual stress
  - HIDRA
  - pyRS
  - Arecibo Telescope
  - pole figures
